        "row_1": {
          "type": "row",
          "settings": {
            "title": "About this product",
            "content_source": "custom",
            "text": "<p>Most face washes either strip your skin or feel like they did nothing. This is a sulfate-free amino acid wash with beef tallow, so skin feels clean without that tight feeling.</p><p>Bakuchiol, a plant-based retinol alternative, and Niacinamide are in the formula, with Centella Asiatica to keep skin calm. Morning and night.</p>",
            "open": true,
            "hide_on_mobile": false,
            "hide_on_desktop": false
          }
        },
        "row_2": {
          "type": "row",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How to use",
            "content_source": "custom",
            "text": "<p>1. Wet your face. Pump 1 to 2 pumps into wet hands.</p><p>2. Work into a lather and massage for 30 to 60 seconds.</p><p>3. Rinse with lukewarm water and pat dry. Use morning and night.</p>",
            "open": false,
            "hide_on_mobile": false,
            "hide_on_desktop": false
          }
        },
        "row_3": {
          "type": "row",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Ingredients",
            "content_source": "custom",
            "text": "<p>Key ingredients: Sodium Cocoyl Glycinate (amino acid cleansing base), beef tallow, Bakuchiol, Niacinamide, Centella Asiatica, Glycerin, Sodium Hyaluronate, Vitamin E, Panthenol, Aloe, Colloidal Oatmeal.</p><p>Full ingredient list:<br>Water, Sodium Cocoyl Glycinate, Cocamidopropyl Betaine, Glycerin, Adeps Bovis (Tallow), Polyquaternium-7, Sodium Chloride, Lauryl Glucoside, Cocamide MEA, Sodium Lauroyl Sarcosinate, Aloe Barbadensis Extract, Centella Asiatica Extract, Colloidal Oatmeal, Panthenol, Niacinamide, Tocopherol, Bakuchiol, Hydroxyacetophenone, 1,2-Hexanediol, Phenoxyethanol, Parfum, Disodium EDTA, PEG-75 Lanolin, Citric Acid, Ethylhexylglycerin, Sodium Hyaluronate.</p>",
            "open": false,
            "hide_on_mobile": false,
            "hide_on_desktop": false
          }
        },
        "row_4": {
          "type": "row",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Delivery and returns",
            "content_source": "custom",
            "text": "<p>Nationwide delivery, with Cash on Delivery available. Every order carries the Zenith Money-Back Guarantee. Full terms on our <a href=\"/policies/refund-policy\">Refunds and Returns</a> page.</p>",
            "open": false,
            "hide_on_mobile": false,
            "hide_on_desktop": false
          }
        },
        "row_5": {
          "type": "row",
          "settings": {
            "title": "FAQs",
            "content_source": "questions",
            "text": "",
            "open": false,
            "hide_on_mobile": false,
            "hide_on_desktop": false
          }
        },
        "question_1": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Will the tallow feel greasy?",
            "answer": "<p>No. It conditions while you wash and rinses off with the lather. Skin feels clean and soft, not coated.</p>",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "question_2": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What is Bakuchiol?",
            "answer": "<p>A plant-based alternative to retinol. It is in the cleanser with Niacinamide, so both are part of your wash, morning and night.</p>",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "question_3": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I use it twice a day?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. It is made for morning and night.</p>",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "question_4": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I use it with the Tallow Cream and the Day Cream?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. It is the first step: Cleanser, then Day Cream SPF 30 in the morning and Tallow Cream at night.</p>",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "question_5": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I use it if my skin is sensitive?",
            "answer": "<p>Check the full ingredient list on this page first. Start with a small amount. If anything feels wrong, stop and message us.</p>",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "question_6": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Paano kung hindi ako hiyang?",
            "answer": "<p>Every order carries the Zenith Money-Back Guarantee. Skin products are covered for 30 days, counted from delivery.</p><p>Message us on Facebook or email hello@tryzenith.ph with your order number and a photo of the product. Full terms on our <a href=\"/policies/refund-policy\">Refunds and Returns</a> page.</p>",
            "open": false
          }
        }
