    "faq": {
      "type": "zenith-faq",
      "blocks": {
        "question_1": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Will this work even if I've never used skincare before?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes! The Zenith Anti-Aging Tallow Cleanser is specifically designed for Filipino men who are new to skincare. Our gentle formula is formulated to work with your skin’s natural processes, making it perfect for beginners. You’ll see results even if this is your first skincare product.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_2": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Hindi ba ito magiging tight or stripping sa face? Ayoko kasing parang soap yung feeling.",
            "answer": "<p>Not at all! We’ve specially formulated the Zenith Anti-Aging Tallow Cleanser with premium amino acid cleansers for the Philippine climate. Unlike harsh cleansers, the Zenith Anti-Aging Tallow Cleanser conditions your skin with tallow while cleansing deeply. It’s gentle enough for daily use but powerful enough to give real results.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_3": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I use this if I have sensitive skin?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes! Tallow actually matches your skin’s natural oils, making it ideal for sensitive skin. The Zenith Anti-Aging Tallow Cleanser uses gentle amino acid cleansers and botanical extracts that are free from harsh chemicals that typically cause irritation.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_4": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How long will one bottle last?",
            "answer": "<p>One 100ml bottle of the Zenith Anti-Aging Tallow Cleanser typically lasts 30 days when used as directed (once daily). A little goes a long way – you only need 2-3 pea-sized pumps as it creates rich lather for your entire face.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_5": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I use this with my other products like moisturizer and sunscreen?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes! The Zenith Anti-Aging Tallow Cleanser works perfectly as the foundation of any skincare routine. For complete anti-aging care, follow with Zenith Anti-Aging Tallow Day Cream SPF 30 in the morning for protection, and Zenith Anti-Aging Tallow Night Cream in the evening for maximum repair and renewal.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_6": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Bakit mas mahal compared sa ibang cleansers sa mall?",
            "answer": "<p>While the Zenith Anti-Aging Tallow Cleanser may cost more upfront, you’re getting premium tallow and concentrated actives that actually work. Most mall brands use cheap surfactants and synthetic ingredients that can actually strip and damage your skin long-term, requiring you to buy more products to fix the problems they create.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_7": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "When will I see results?",
            "answer": "<p>Many men notice cleaner, softer-feeling skin with consistent use of the Zenith Anti-Aging Tallow Cleanser. Everyone’s skin is different, which is why we offer the Zenith Money-Back Guarantee.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
